ref=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heth\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heth</a>) And it is pronounced as Lostlight's link says.<br /> <br /> For those who are interested, it's the answer to the age old question of 'is it spelled Hanukkah or Chanukkah'; neither it is spelled <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Alef\">\u05d7\u05b2\u05e0\u05bb\u05db\u05b8\u05bc\u05d4 (that's read right to left by the way).</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T18:10:53-07:00","id":1148714,"title":"","content":"Sounds like a &quot;k&quot; sound to me - then again, I'm also a bit hard-of-hearing.<br /> <br /> I'm assuming that you're supposed to pronounce it a bit further back in the throat?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T21:43:02-07:00","id":1148749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1143895-jackals-zombie-mini-template?p=1148714#post1148714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sounds like a &quot;k&quot; sound to me - then again, I'm also a bit hard-of-hearing.<br /> <br /> I'm assuming that you're supposed to pronounce it a bit further back in the throat?</div> </div> </div> </div>yeah, it should be pronounced from the back of the throat- but there is a common phenomena that people who can't pronounce a certain sound also can't hear it, hence the difficulties. Anyway, you I assume you can pronounce &quot;Tachrichim&quot; as &quot;Takrikim&quot; and the Academy for Hebrew Language (it's a thing) won't send their language ninjas and cut your throat, but I still do enjoy this :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T21:47:10-07:00","id":1148750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1143895-jackals-zombie-mini-template?p=1148700#post1148700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the letter Chet (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heth\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heth</a>) And it is pronounced as Lostlight's link says.<br /> <br /> For those who are interested, it's the answer to the age old question of 'is it spelled Hanukkah or Chanukkah'; neither it is spelled <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:Alef\">\u05d7\u05b2\u05e0\u05bb\u05db\u05b8\u05bc\u05d4 (that's read right to left by the way).</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, the letter is called Chaf- which is a letter that has two to to be pronounces, depends where it is found in a sentence- either as &quot;k&quot; or &quot;ch&quot;. In theory, there is a difference between Heith and Chaf, but even most modern hebrew speakers can't hear or pronounce it (certain communities excluded), so it is, in practice, the same sound.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T08:28:37-07:00","id":1148830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1143895-jackals-zombie-mini-template?p=1148750#post1148750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, the letter is called Chaf- which is a letter that has two to to be pronounces, depends where it is found in a sentence- either as &quot;k&quot; or &quot;ch&quot;. In theory, there is a difference between Heith and Chaf, but even most modern hebrew speakers can't hear or pronounce it (certain communities excluded), so it is, in practice, the same sound.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh really, guess that's what I get for not looking up the word in question. I just assumed a Chet, but yeah, the difference between Kof and CHet can be lost depending on speaker (my pronounciation is terrrible since I come from an Ashkenazi family but grew up in Washington state where there are like 10 jews total and they are all Sephardic (I kid a bit)).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-12T18:20:04-07:00","id":1149284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1143895-jackals-zombie-mini-template?p=1148749#post1148749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">yeah, it should be pronounced from the back of the throat- but there is a common phenomena that people who can't pronounce a certain sound also can't hear it, hence the difficulties. Anyway, you I assume you can pronounce &quot;Tachrichim&quot; as &quot;Takrikim&quot; and the Academy for Hebrew Language (it's a thing) won't send their language ninjas and cut your throat, but I still do enjoy this :P</div> </div> </div> </div>I probably wouldn't be able to hear it even if I could pronounce it. Hearing for me involves a <i>lot</i> of mind reading.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}